---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";

const shippingData = [
  ["DHL Express","2-4 business days","$65 for orders under $800","Full tracking, signature on delivery"],
  ["FedEx International Priority","2-5 business days","$60 for orders under $800","US/Canada/EU preferred"],
  ["UPS Worldwide Express","2-5 business days","$65 for orders under $800","Strong US West Coast network"],
  ["TNT Express","3-6 business days","$60 for orders under $800","Middle East/Africa specialist"],
];
---

<PageLayout title="Shipping & Delivery Policy — Worldwide Courier" description="Worldwide peptide shipping: DHL/FedEx/UPS/TNT, 2-6 day transit, tracking within 3 business days. Free shipping on orders over $800. Customs documentation included.">
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-narrow mx-auto px-4">
    <h1>Shipping & Delivery Policy</h1>

    <!-- Key Stats Box -->
    <div class="card bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-white border-blue-200 mt-6 p-5">
      <h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-3">Key Statistics</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-center">
        <div><span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">4</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Carrier Options</span></div>
        <div><span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">2–6</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Business Day Transit</span></div>
        <div><span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">3</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Days to Tracking</span></div>
        <div><span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">$800</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Free Shipping Threshold</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6">
      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Carrier Network</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600">We ship from our Shenzhen fulfillment center via four global carriers. Every shipment is temperature-monitored and insured. Here's a real example from last month: a 10-vial kit to Rotterdam cleared customs in 4 days flat on DHL Express — that's typical for EU destinations with proper documentation.</p>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto mt-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <table class="w-full text-sm">
            <thead><tr class="bg-gray-50"><th class="text-left py-2 px-3 font-semibold">Carrier</th><th class="text-left py-2 px-3 font-semibold">Transit</th><th class="text-left py-2 px-3 font-semibold">Cost (sub-$800)</th><th class="text-left py-2 px-3 font-semibold">Best For</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>{shippingData.map((r,i)=>(<tr class={i%2===0?'bg-white':'bg-gray-50/50'}><td class="py-2 px-3 font-medium">{r[0]}</td><td class="py-2 px-3 text-accent-dark">{r[1]}</td><td class="py-2 px-3">{r[2]}</td><td class="py-2 px-3 text-gray-500 text-xs">{r[3]}</td></tr>))}</tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Geographic Coverage</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600">North America, European Union, United Kingdom, Australia, New Zealand, Japan, South Korea, Singapore, and most other Asia-Pacific regions. If your country has an active DHL/FedEx route, we can reach you.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2 mt-3">
          {["United States","Canada","United Kingdom","Germany","France","Netherlands","Australia","New Zealand","Japan","Singapore","South Korea","Switzerland"].map(c=>(<span class="text-xs bg-gray-100 rounded px-2 py-1 text-gray-600">{c}</span>))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Tracking & Timeline</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Tracking number issued within <strong>3 business days</strong> after order confirmation. This isn't because we're slow — it's because every shipment undergoes a final QC document review before dispatch. COA, packing list, and MSDS are triple-checked against your order. Transit: typically 5–10 business days for major markets, 7–14 for secondary.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Free Shipping</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Orders over <strong>$800</strong> qualify for free worldwide delivery. For recurring wholesale accounts, we offer negotiated carrier rates — bulk shipments of 20+ kits ship at cost.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Customs & Duties</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Buyer is responsible for import duties, taxes, and customs clearance. We provide the necessary export documentation (<strong>commercial invoice, packing list, Certificate of Analysis, and MSDS</strong>) with every shipment. For countries with strict import regulations, we recommend confirming peptide classification with your local customs authority before ordering.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Packaging Standards</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600">All vials ship in vacuum-sealed, moisture-barrier packaging inside insulated containers. Temperature loggers available on request for bulk orders. Each kit includes a unique batch-traceable serial number that maps to the original QC data.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card bg-surface border-accent/20">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">FAQ</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <details><summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-accent">How long does shipping to the US actually take?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">FedEx International Priority: 2-4 business days to major US hubs. DHL: 3-5. We've consistently hit 3 days to New York and 4 to Los Angeles in 2026. Remote/rural addresses add 1-2 days.</p></details>
          <details><summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-accent">What if customs holds my package?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">Rare, but it happens. We provide complete documentation (COA, commercial invoice, MSDS) to expedite clearance. If held, contact us — we'll work with the carrier to resolve. In 2025, <1% of our shipments experienced customs holds beyond 1 business day.</p></details>
          <details><summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer hover:text-accent">Is discreet packaging available?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">Standard outer packaging is neutral — no "peptide" or product branding visible. Inner packaging is clearly labeled for customs compliance. We do not misdeclare contents or falsify invoices — that's illegal and puts your shipment at risk.</p></details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card bg-surface border-accent/20">
        <p class="text-primary-light font-medium text-sm italic">FOR LABORATORY RESEARCH USE ONLY. NOT FOR MEDICAL USE.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
<div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 text-sm text-gray-500">
      <span>Related: </span>
      <a href="/terms/" class="text-accent-dark hover:underline">Terms & Conditions</a> &middot;
      <a href="/privacy/" class="text-accent-dark hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> &middot;
      <a href="/contact/" class="text-accent-dark hover:underline">Contact Us</a> &middot;
      <a href="/faq/" class="text-accent-dark hover:underline">FAQ</a>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="section bg-gray-50">
  <div class="container-wide mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <h2 class="mb-4">Explore Our Products</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-6">Factory-direct research peptides with batch-specific COA. Browse popular products:</p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center">
      <a href="/products/semaglutide/" class="card px-5 py-3 hover:border-accent/30 transition-colors text-sm font-medium text-primary">Semaglutide</a>
      <a href="/products/tirzepatide/" class="card px-5 py-3 hover:border-accent/30 transition-colors text-sm font-medium text-primary">Tirzepatide</a>
      <a href="/products/bpc-157/" class="card px-5 py-3 hover:border-accent/30 transition-colors text-sm font-medium text-primary">BPC-157</a>
      <a href="/products/" class="card px-5 py-3 bg-accent/5 border-accent/30 transition-colors text-sm font-bold text-accent">All Products &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</PageLayout>